=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a pytest hook whose entry becomes an echo of pytest runs no suite
origin: issue #196 rulings 191.5 and 191.7 — the hook keeps its id and its name, and its entry still names
origin2: pytest, but echo text runs nothing: the config ran a suite at base and runs none at head. v0.5.0
origin3: counted the echo as a live test hook and passed this diff.
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: echo pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
